&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZMy2dO64woKwnYxgCPZlQBGGgvc&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Information Technology, Computer Science, Engineering, Cybersecurity, or a related field — or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYBAdkRaxovcOtxcvj0lLJwbghc&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong experience supporting macOS in an enterprise environment.&lt;/div&gt;
