&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build our multi-platform unified IM &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SDK&lt;/strong&gt; — unify the logic core across platforms and push performance and stability as a lever for growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zb6zdhFSZo9I1mxkvlel91XIgQf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platformize the engine&lt;/strong&gt; — turn it into a platform that product teams build business scenarios on (community chat, payments, VIP service).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S71td2mDeosf2KxfY1klwexigbf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build user-to-agent (AI) chat&lt;/strong&gt; — the conversational AI surface on top of IM, from real-time delivery to the agent interaction experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RrkTdxi29o3DHJxASOblaNmygBe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt; — real-time WebSocket long-connection and offline push across overseas + China vendor channels — so messages reach users whether the app is open or not.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzG7dkiikoKYJcxJpOilsfoYg4u&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
