&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RSqud0veDoINJKxbmOZlThukgQb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build our AI-native engineering practice&lt;/strong&gt; — design automated development workflows and harness systems (agents, evals, guardrails, CI integration) that let AI do real engineering work, while safeguarding delivery quality and efficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GA4zdNZvEoJBbvxpl7allKWHglh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar &lt;/strong&gt;through design and code review, and by making the engineers around you better.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UZ1Sd20h5olPLYxjHVAlAXH9gsd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
