&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You apply AI deeply in your own engineering — not just code generation&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ve built, or are driven to build, automated development workflows and harnesses that make delivery both faster and more reliable. Solid grasp of LLM fundamentals, prompt engineering, RAG, and agent concepts, with hands-on experience taking an AI pipeline from scratch to shipped — and you&#39;re excited to build user-facing conversational / agent-chat experiences too.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NgUkdmj7noIvhexihVel0i3igof&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable with &lt;strong&gt;ambiguity and high scale&lt;/strong&gt; — you&#39;ve debugged problems that only appear under real production load.&lt;/div&gt;
