&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLY5dUBM6oAiIvxnoY7lWjuighh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Signals we value: you naturally &lt;strong&gt;raise the standard of teams you join&lt;/strong&gt;, mentor without being asked, and can grow into a technical anchor for the group.&lt;/div&gt;
